  "head_commit": {
    "id": "5e4eb9c75bcb0559dfe8ab40df6566c8fc6e96b5",
    "tree_id": "a8567d4014a5310e0ac03b29791ac1643108e2c9",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:731] build(delivery): private IPA 731 = the delivered 730 with the S2Arm image pack fix (Mario Kart World launch)\n\nFrozen on 8667a630 (effective digest fd4c9ec6, 7922 product files). Base: the\ndelivered and verified 730 (run 43226062701).\n- S2Arm bridge fix b3c2fe6a, per session 04:\n  - the image pack is written to <game>/images, outside the module\n    directory that the preparation replaces at its end, so it is no longer\n    deleted;\n  - a preparation whose image pack is missing or empty fails at the module\n    stage instead of passing with 0 bytes.\n  On 730 Mario Kart World prepared in 439 s, then the launch failed with\n  errno 2 on the deleted pack. Preparations made by 730 are redone.\n- XeniaCore 2d176a7f, S2Arm engine 175018a2, RPCS3 Core 934 and MeloNX\n  Core 743 kept.\nNothing of this build was run on an iPhone; no FPS, memory, heat or\nstability claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-12T14:33:03Z",
